(2, 'welcome-to-arobic-recruitment-consultant-2', 'Welcome to Arobic Recruitment Consultant', 'Arobic Recruitment Consultant is situation in capital Dhaka of Bangladesh. It is located Almost 8  kilometer from airport. This firm following labor law of government exports manpower as per demand to foreign clear companies. This company is self reputed progressive skill worker develop. This firm conduct international standard business standing on rules of country and direct to improvement of our honorable customer supplier and related all.', 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=MusIvEKjqsc', '632ad5907c0f4-Welcome to Arobic Recruitment Consultant !.jpg', '2022-09-11 04:48:03', '2022-11-10 12:58:15', 1);
