(13, 'ClydeFuh', 'michaelrp62@gmail.com', '87634689573', 'Your tax credit', 'Hi. I\'m reaching out to see whether you’ve applied for the covid-related Employee Retention Tax Credit? This credit is worth up to $26k per employee, and you *can* qualify for both this and PPP (the rules changed Nov 2021).  We can help you maximize this credit and have already done this for more than 160 businesses. All our work is free until you receive a refund. Give us a call at 424-512-1530 or email hello@refundspro.com for more info.', '2022-11-09 19:41:48', '2022-11-09 19:41:48'),
