(404, 'Sayeed Rahman', 'sayeed@discovertraining.net', '02033349874', 'Collaboration with Discover Training', 'Hi,\r\n\r\nI’m Sayeed Rahman, Business Development Manager at Discover Training, a trusted provider of CPDQS-accredited e-learning solutions. We offer a library of over 2,000 high-quality courses across a wide range of categories, designed to meet the needs of modern learners.\r\n\r\nI’d like to introduce an exciting white-label partnership opportunity. By collaborating with us, you’ll gain access to our entire premium course library, which you can resell under your own branding and pricing. Our flexible solution integrates seamlessly into your setup, even if you don’t have an LMS, enabling you to expand your offerings effortlessly without creating or managing content.\r\n\r\nOur courses cover professional development, compliance, and industry-specific training, helping you deliver value-packed solutions to your audience while growing your portfolio.\r\n\r\nIf this piques your interest, let’s arrange a short 10-15 mins call to explore this in more detail and figure out how we can work together. I look forward to your reply!\r\n\r\nBest regards,\r\nSayeed Rahman\r\nBusiness Development Manager\r\nDiscover Training', '2025-01-02 10:39:47', '2025-01-02 10:39:47'),
