(2, 'construction', 'Construction', '6322ea086c5cd-Construction.jpg', 'Our workers are skilled in construction work and they can use advanced machinery used in construction. They have made themselves more qualified by working on several big projects in present day Bangladesh.', '<p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Roboto, sans-serif; font-size: 17px;\">Our workers are skilled in construction work and they can use advanced machinery used in construction. They have made themselves more qualified by working on several big projects in present day Bangladesh.</span></p><p><img src=\"data:image/jpeg;base64,\" style=\"width: 100%;\" data-filename=\"pexels-burst-3.jpeg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Roboto, sans-serif; font-size: 17px;\"><br></span></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Roboto, sans-serif; font-size: 17px;\">Our workers are skilled in construction work and they can use advanced machinery used in construction. They have made themselves more qualified by working on several big projects in present day Bangladesh.</span><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Roboto, sans-serif; font-size: 17px;\"><br></span><br></p>', '2022-09-15 03:02:00', '2022-09-15 03:02:00', 1);
